{"seq":3,"slug":"price-band-matrix-coverage","title":"价格带与商品矩阵覆盖缺口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/category-role-structure/price-band-matrix-coverage","wordCount":1769,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"价格带与商品矩阵覆盖缺口\">价格带与商品矩阵覆盖缺口</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把品类里的所有 SKU 按售价投到一条价格轴上，你会看到一些区间挤满了商品、一些区间空着。<strong>价格带（price band / price zone）</strong> 就是把这条轴切成若干有业务含义的区间，然后逐个检查：这个区间有货吗？有货的话有几款？各款在哪几个功能/规格层级上？</p>\n<p>价格带缺口分析要回答的不是&quot;我缺不缺货&quot;，而是&quot;用户带着一个具体的预算意图进来，我能不能接住他&quot;。用户不会说&quot;我要 30 到 40 欧元的&quot;，但会形成&quot;这个类别大概值这个价&quot;的习惯性预期——这类<strong>习惯性价格点</strong>一旦被越过，需求会以超过价格涨幅的比例下降。价格点之所以存在，是因为需求曲线呈现&quot;一系列波浪而非一条直线&quot;，越过点位后总收入会下降；其成因分为替代价格点（贴着某款替代品定价）、习惯价格点（市场习惯为某类商品支付某个金额）与感知价格点（心理定价，例如越过整数位后需求不成比例地下跌）三类（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Price_point\">Price point，Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p>这解释了为什么价格带不能均匀切分。按等宽切分（0–10、10–20、20–30……）会把真正的拥堵点和真正的空洞抹平；带边界应当落在<strong>感知价格点</strong>上，例如 19.9、29.9、49.9、99.9 这类位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商品矩阵的两条轴\">商品矩阵的两条轴</h2><p>价格带只是一条轴。单看价格带会误判——&quot;29.9 欧元区间有 12 款&quot;听起来很饱满，但如果这 12 款全是同一功能定位的近似替代品，用户在 29.9 欧元这个价位上依然只有一个实质选择，缺口只是被数量掩盖了。</p>\n<p>完整的矩阵由两条轴构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>价格轴</strong>：按感知价格点切分，每段代表一个预算意图层级。</li>\n<li><strong>属性轴</strong>：该品类用户真正会用来区分商品的功能维度（容量、材质、功率、适用场景、规格等级）。属性轴的取值不应由商品团队主观决定，而应由搜索词聚类与商品页筛选器使用频次反推。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>矩阵的每个格子记录 SKU 数与近 90 天的贡献毛利额。缺口有两种形态：<strong>空格</strong>（该组合完全没有商品）与<strong>虚格</strong>（有商品但销量近乎为零，说明这个组合不被市场接受或曝光不足）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[品类 SKU 全集] --&gt; B[按售价映射到感知价格点分段]&#10;  B --&gt; C[按属性维度聚合]&#10;  C --&gt; D[价格 x 属性 矩阵]&#10;  D --&gt; E{格子状态}&#10;  E --&gt;|SKU=0| F[硬缺口&lt;br/&gt;需求可能未被满足]&#10;  E --&gt;|SKU&gt;0 且销量≈0| G[虚格&lt;br/&gt;伪需求或曝光不足]&#10;  E --&gt;|SKU&gt;0 且销量健康| H[已覆盖]&#10;  F --&gt; I[进入选品候选]&#10;  G --&gt; J[下架评审或曝光补足]&#10;  H --&gt; K[保持结构]\">graph TD\n  A[品类 SKU 全集] --&gt; B[按售价映射到感知价格点分段]\n  B --&gt; C[按属性维度聚合]\n  C --&gt; D[价格 x 属性 矩阵]\n  D --&gt; E{格子状态}\n  E --&gt;|SKU=0| F[硬缺口&lt;br/&gt;需求可能未被满足]\n  E --&gt;|SKU&gt;0 且销量≈0| G[虚格&lt;br/&gt;伪需求或曝光不足]\n  E --&gt;|SKU&gt;0 且销量健康| H[已覆盖]\n  F --&gt; I[进入选品候选]\n  G --&gt; J[下架评审或曝光补足]\n  H --&gt; K[保持结构]</pre><p>硬缺口进选品候选，虚格进下架或曝光评审。两条出口分别通向 <a href=\"../localized-selection/search-gap-competitor-driven-selection\">搜索空白/竞品驱动选品</a> 与 <a href=\"../assortment-lifecycle-kpi/shelf-delist-lastplace-rule\">末位淘汰与退市</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算覆盖缺口的-sql\">计算覆盖缺口的 SQL</h2><p>矩阵必须能在数据库里直接算出来，否则它只能停在 PPT 上。下面这段查询把售价按配置的感知价格点分桶，按属性维度聚合，输出每个格子的 SKU 数、销量与贡献毛利额，并标记硬缺口与虚格。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH band_map AS (&#10;  SELECT band_id, label, low_price, high_price&#10;  FROM assortment_price_band&#10;  WHERE category_id = $1 AND market_code = $2&#10;), sku_band AS (&#10;  SELECT s.sku_id, s.attr_tier, s.list_price, b.band_id, b.label&#10;  FROM assortment_sku s&#10;  JOIN band_map b&#10;    ON s.list_price &gt;= b.low_price AND s.list_price &lt; b.high_price&#10;  WHERE s.category_id = $1 AND s.market_code = $2 AND s.status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;), sales AS (&#10;  SELECT sku_id,&#10;         SUM(units)                                   AS units_90d,&#10;         SUM(units * (unit_price - unit_var_cost))    AS cm_90d&#10;  FROM sales_fact&#10;  WHERE order_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY sku_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT sb.band_id,&#10;       sb.label                                       AS price_band,&#10;       sb.attr_tier,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT sb.sku_id)                      AS sku_count,&#10;       COALESCE(SUM(sa.units_90d), 0)                 AS units_90d,&#10;       ROUND(COALESCE(SUM(sa.cm_90d), 0), 2)          AS cm_90d,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN COUNT(DISTINCT sb.sku_id) = 0                    THEN &#39;hard_gap&#39;&#10;         WHEN COALESCE(SUM(sa.units_90d), 0) &lt; $3              THEN &#39;phantom&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;covered&#39;&#10;       END                                            AS cell_state&#10;FROM (SELECT DISTINCT band_id, label, attr_tier FROM sku_band) sb&#10;LEFT JOIN sku_band k ON k.band_id = sb.band_id AND k.attr_tier = sb.attr_tier&#10;LEFT JOIN sales sa   ON sa.sku_id = k.sku_id&#10;GROUP BY sb.band_id, sb.label, sb.attr_tier&#10;ORDER BY sb.band_id, sb.attr_tier;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_id, label, low_price, high_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assortment_price_band</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), sku_band </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">label</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assortment_sku s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_map b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">low_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">high_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> units_90d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (unit_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_var_cost))    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cm_90d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                       AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_band,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units_90d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> units_90d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cm_90d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cm_90d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hard_gap'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units_90d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'phantom'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'covered'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                            AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cell_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_id, label, attr_tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_band) sb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_band k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales sa   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>hard_gap</code> 分支实际上永远不会被触发，因为 <code>sku_band</code> 是内连接的产物——真正的空格需要用价格带表与属性维度表的<strong>笛卡尔积</strong>来左连接。这是一个经典陷阱：用交易数据算缺口，空着的格子在里面根本不存在，于是永远看不见。正确写法是从维度表出发做左连接。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH dim AS (&#10;  SELECT b.band_id, b.label, t.attr_tier&#10;  FROM assortment_price_band b&#10;  CROSS JOIN assortment_attr_tier t&#10;  WHERE b.category_id = $1 AND t.category_id = $1&#10;)&#10;SELECT dim.*, COALESCE(c.sku_count, 0) AS sku_count&#10;FROM dim&#10;LEFT JOIN (&#10;  SELECT band_id, attr_tier, COUNT(*) AS sku_count&#10;  FROM assortment_sku&#10;  WHERE category_id = $1 AND market_code = $2 AND status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY band_id, attr_tier&#10;) c ON c.band_id = dim.band_id AND c.attr_tier = dim.attr_tier;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assortment_price_band b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CROSS JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assortment_attr_tier t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_id, attr_tier, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assortment_sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_id, attr_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attr_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缺口判定的三重过滤\">缺口判定的三重过滤</h2><p>不是每个硬缺口都该被填。填一个空格子要花 OTB 预算、要占库位、要承担滞销风险，因此必须过三道过滤。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一道-需求侧是否有信号\">第一道：需求侧是否有信号</h3><p>空格子的需求可能真实存在但无人满足，也可能根本不存在。判据来自搜索需求：该价格带 × 属性组合对应的搜索词有没有稳定搜索量。没有搜索量的组合是伪需求——用户根本没在找它，填进去只会变成新的虚格。搜索需求信号的取法见 <a href=\"../localized-selection/search-gap-competitor-driven-selection\">搜索空白/竞品驱动选品</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二道-竞品是否已占据\">第二道：竞品是否已占据</h3><p>如果竞品在这个价格带密度很高，说明需求真实存在，但同时也说明这是红海。判定要区分&quot;空白&quot;与&quot;被占领&quot;：<strong>空白</strong>是没人做，<strong>被占领</strong>是有人做而且做得很好。后者进入的理由只能是差异化（更好的规格、更快的履约、更低的到岸成本），不能只是&quot;我也有一款&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三道-自身供应链是否支持这个价格\">第三道：自身供应链是否支持这个价格</h3><p>价格带决定成本上限。进 9.9 欧元价格带的商品，其到岸成本加履约成本必须能压进这个价位还能留出贡献毛利；如果品类现有供应链最低成本做不到，这个缺口就是战略性的，需要先解决供应链再谈铺货。到岸成本与关税的构成见 <a href=\"../../landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/\">跨境 Landed Cost 与完税交货</a>——但那属于另一个 hub 的职责，本 hub 只取用它给出的成本上限约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格带与角色-宽度的交汇\">价格带与角色、宽度的交汇</h2><p>价格带覆盖不是独立的第五件事，它是角色与宽度决策的校验面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交汇点</th>\n<th>校验问题</th>\n<th>不通过的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格带 × 角色</td>\n<td>流量款是否覆盖了该市场的主流感知价格点？</td>\n<td>流量款接不住主流搜索，曝光转化崩塌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格带 × 深度</td>\n<td>核心价格带的 SKU 是否备得足够深？</td>\n<td>核心带频繁断货，把用户推给竞品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格带 × 宽度</td>\n<td>高价带是否堆了过多近似替代品？</td>\n<td>结构虚胖，长尾 SKU 拖累动销率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格带 × 形象款</td>\n<td>形象款是否站在价格带最上沿？</td>\n<td>定价锚无法上移，整个品类的毛利天花板被封死</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行的问题在宽浅结构里特别常见：为了凑&quot;宽&quot;，运营在同一热门价格带堆大量近似款，结果每个款都卖不动，动销率被拉低。这类结构的诊断与整治属于 <a href=\"../assortment-lifecycle-kpi/category-lifecycle-rationalization\">品类/单品生命周期与汰换</a> 与 <a href=\"../assortment-lifecycle-kpi/category-sellthrough-profit-kpi\">动销率/贡献毛利/品类健康 KPI</a> 的范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价格带必须切在感知价格点上，而非等宽切分；越点后需求下降幅度超过价格上升幅度，总收入反而下降是价格点存在的实证含义。</li>\n<li>商品矩阵由价格轴与属性轴共同构成，单看价格带会被&quot;同价位近似替代品&quot;掩盖真正的缺口。</li>\n<li>算缺口必须从维度表笛卡尔积出发左连接交易数据；从交易表出发的空格子在数据里根本不存在。</li>\n<li>格子状态三分：硬缺口（进选品）、虚格（进下架或曝光评审）、已覆盖。</li>\n<li>填缺口要过三重过滤：需求侧有搜索信号、竞品不是压倒性占领、自身供应链能支持该价位。</li>\n<li>价格带覆盖是角色与宽度决策的校验面，四个交汇点各有明确的失败后果。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价格带与商品矩阵覆盖缺口","id":"价格带与商品矩阵覆盖缺口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"商品矩阵的两条轴","id":"商品矩阵的两条轴"},{"level":2,"text":"计算覆盖缺口的 SQL","id":"计算覆盖缺口的-sql"},{"level":2,"text":"缺口判定的三重过滤","id":"缺口判定的三重过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"第一道：需求侧是否有信号","id":"第一道-需求侧是否有信号"},{"level":3,"text":"第二道：竞品是否已占据","id":"第二道-竞品是否已占据"},{"level":3,"text":"第三道：自身供应链是否支持这个价格","id":"第三道-自身供应链是否支持这个价格"},{"level":2,"text":"价格带与角色、宽度的交汇","id":"价格带与角色-宽度的交汇"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"品类宽度 × 深度权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/category-role-structure/assortment-width-depth-tradeoff"},"next":{"title":"市场差异与本地化选品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/localized-selection/market-assortment-localization"}}